### 8. First functional vertical slice

The first slice will demonstrate the core value: a person can enter what they know, see what is missing, and leave with a usable record — all without sharing identity.

**Slice scope:**
- Stage 1: Who needs clarity? (subject type only, no identity fields)
- Stage 2: Core health knowledge questions (high BP, cholesterol, diabetes, heart condition, smoking, family history)
- Stage 3: Automatic gap detection for those fields
- Outputs: Heart Risk Audit Record and Missing-Information Summary (identity-free)
- Local save and resume via localStorage
- Print-friendly layout of both outputs
- No payment gate in slice (for internal validation); the full product paywall will be added later.

This slice can be built and tested independently, and will prove the structural approach before adding the remaining fields, outputs and sharing choices.

