### 10. Deliberately excluded from version one

- Clinical risk calculators, QRISK, SCORE2 or any similar algorithm — not a diagnostic tool.
- Direct integration with electronic health records or patient portals.
- Account creation, cloud backup or multi-device sync.
- Sharing via link, email or messaging.
- AI-generated suggestions or interpretation.
- Reminders or appointment scheduling.
- Support for more than one concurrent “helper” per subject.
- Custom colour themes or high-fidelity visual design exploration.
- Translations beyond UK English.
- PDF generation with embedded fonts beyond system fallbacks (basic styling accepted).
- Any tracking, analytics or cookies beyond what is strictly necessary for payment verification.

